# w3id.org/onymous/ — Onymous Intelligence Studies 术语命名空间
# Persistent URIs for the Onymous Intelligence terminological system.
# 维护：wend4336 —— 修改解析目标请向 perma-id/w3id.org 提 PR 更新本文件。

Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on

# 根：命名空间主页 → 仓库 README（立名宣言）
RewriteRule ^$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies#readme [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^index(\.html?)?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies#readme [R=303,L]

# 总纲
RewriteRule ^onymous-intelligence/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies#readme [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^onymity/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/GLOSSARY.md [R=303,L]

# 三个本体与地带
RewriteRule ^staked-attestor/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/00-naming/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^ablation-zone/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/00-naming/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^ablation-surface/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/00-naming/README.md [R=303,L]

# 法：穿越与类型学
RewriteRule ^traversal/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/01-law/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^six-flows/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/01-law/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^attestation-flow/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/01-law/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^evaporation/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/01-law/README.md [R=303,L]

# 制：柜台
RewriteRule ^attestation/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/GLOSSARY.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^counter/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/02-institution/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^attestation-counter/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/02-institution/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^ledgering/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/GLOSSARY.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^chargeback/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/02-institution/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^bad-debt/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/GLOSSARY.md [R=303,L]

# 器：年轮与指标
RewriteRule ^growth-rings/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/03-instrument/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^ring-metrics/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/03-instrument/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^TraversalEvent/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/spec/traversal-event.md [R=303,L]

# 动与币
RewriteRule ^gap/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/04-dynamics/README.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^domain-genres/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/04-dynamics/appendix-a-domain-genres.md [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^money-proposition/?$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/papers/05-currency/README.md [R=303,L]

# 兜底：未列名路径 → 术语总表
RewriteRule ^.*$ https://github.com/wend4336/onymous-intelligence-studies/blob/main/GLOSSARY.md [R=303,L]
